01:31.658 --> 01:35.579
tearing off a broken roof. And in the back, This

01:35.599 --> 01:40.663
is not a case of incapacity. This is apparent.

02:04.322 --> 02:05.222
who can't let go.

02:08.583 --> 02:10.963
