02:40.212 --> 02:44.234
see he took a stand A wall of facts, a wall of proof

02:44.654 --> 02:48.776
It's tearing up a broken roof And in the back, my

02:49.017 --> 02:53.139
family Sixteen strong, all here for me This

02:53.319 --> 03:02.303
isn't a fight, it's a release She has no case

03:02.704 --> 03:04.725
She has no case

